        {
          "atom_id": "atom::b1b2b4a788459b5a51e65156",
          "source_handle": "P0144",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "尽管ICIs改变了实体瘤的治疗格局，但患者响应率不均且存在耐药性。肿瘤内在机制无法完全解释个体差异。本研究旨在厘清肠道微生物群如何作为“类器官”系统调节宿主免疫从而影响ICI疗效和毒性，并为开发基于微生物群的联合疗法提供理论依据。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::660a40da6b6fd9baeeaa7c45"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0144"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::b64e8231f73616bfd2a80810",
          "source_handle": "P0144",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "肠道微生物群（Gut Microbiome）与实体瘤免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs，如PD-1/PD-L1、CTLA-4阻断剂）疗效及免疫相关不良反应（irAEs）之间的关系。涵盖机制研究（细菌菌株、代谢物、PRR信号）、临床关联数据及转化策略（FMT）。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::660a40da6b6fd9baeeaa7c45"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0144"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::b68c8ed6f12e1aedb57b11ad",
          "source_handle": "P0144",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "本文是一篇综述，旨在总结肠道微生物群影响ICIs疗效和毒性的现有机制证据，并探讨靶向微生物群的潜在治疗策略。文章首先阐述了肠道作为免疫界面的解剖学和生理学基础，随后详细讨论了特定有益菌属（如Akkermansia muciniphila、Bacteroides）及其代谢产物（短链脂肪酸SCFAs、肌苷、色氨酸代谢物）如何通过调节先天性和适应性免疫反应来增强抗肿瘤免疫。此外，文章分析了微生物群通过肠-肺轴等途径参与irAEs（特别是结肠炎和肺炎）的机制，并重点评估了粪便微生物移植（FMT）在治疗难治性ICI相关结肠炎中的临床应用现状、疗效、安全性及局限性。最后，文章指出了当前研究在标准化和可重复性方面的不足，并提出了未来结合多组学和人工智能进行精准医疗的方向。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::660a40da6b6fd9baeeaa7c45"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0144"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::8eb717837768e243082daa6d",
          "source_handle": "P0144",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "临床关联多为观察性研究，因果链条在人类中尚未完全确立；不同癌症类型的结果可能存在异质性。",
            "contribution": "提供了肠道微生物群影响ICI疗效的临床关联证据和机制假说。具体包括：指出Akkermansia丰度与响应正相关，Bacteroides关联复杂，Alpha多样性具有预测潜力但非唯一指标。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::660a40da6b6fd9baeeaa7c45"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0144"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::4a43c8c569fda1a67abdda11",
          "source_handle": "P0144",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "许多机制细节主要基于动物模型或体外研究，在人体内的确切效力和剂量依赖性尚需验证；部分代谢物（如肌苷）的作用具有情境依赖性。",
            "contribution": "详细阐述了微生物群调节抗肿瘤免疫的具体分子和细胞机制。包括：1) 代谢物（SCFAs, Inosine, Tryptophan derivatives）对T细胞功能的重编程；2) PRR信号通路（TLR/NOD）对DC成熟和抗原呈递的增强；3) 肠-肺轴介导的远端器官免疫调节。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::660a40da6b6fd9baeeaa7c45"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0144"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::dc672e268c1b1c1711f2806d",
          "source_handle": "P0144",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "机制多为推测性或基于间接证据，直接证明特定微生物导致特定irAEs的人类数据有限。",
            "contribution": "提供了微生物群介导ICI毒性（irAEs）的机制解释，特别是结肠炎和肺炎。指出 dysbiosis 通过破坏屏障、改变代谢物和调节Th17/Treg平衡导致系统性炎症。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::660a40da6b6fd9baeeaa7c45"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0144"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::a81d31495d1e91c5f2dec021",
          "source_handle": "P0144",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "讨论了FMT作为挽救疗法的短期有效性与长期不确定性，对比了UC和CDI的复发率以推断ICI相关结肠炎的预后。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::660a40da6b6fd9baeeaa7c45"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0144"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::c97341e86237730f0e4217ea",
          "source_handle": "P0144",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "指出当前研究在样本采集、测序和分析方法上的不标准化限制了可重复性，呼吁多中心长期队列和AI辅助的多组学研究。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::660a40da6b6fd9baeeaa7c45"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0144"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::0027ef883336f58d1bc2845a",
          "source_handle": "P0144",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "该综述主要关注固体肿瘤，虽然提及了黑色素瘤和非小细胞肺癌，但不一定涵盖血液肿瘤或所有实体瘤亚型。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::660a40da6b6fd9baeeaa7c45"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0144"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::31202fddebb7567b81ac4184",
          "source_handle": "P0144",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "对于Bacteroides的作用，文中明确指出证据不一致，需谨慎解读，避免将其简单归类为“有益”或“有害”，应强调菌株特异性和情境依赖性。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::660a40da6b6fd9baeeaa7c45"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0144"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::e1aed6019e6c69a7f1354c73",
          "source_handle": "P0144",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "FMT的数据主要来自病例报告和小型系列研究，证据等级较低，不能代表标准护理方案，仅作为探索性治疗手段讨论。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
