            "conditions": "Fungal beta-glucans",
            "finding": "Intact triple-helix conformation is essential for Dectin-1 binding and immune activation; extraction-induced disruption abolishes activity."
          },
          "atom_id": "atom::28653169b560c809e93eab96",
          "chapter_id": "Ch5"
        },
        {
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "Plant/Marine polysaccharides",
            "finding": "C-2/C-3 acetylation or sulfation degree are key determinants of TLR4/MyD88 signaling intensity and ROS scavenging."
          },
          "atom_id": "atom::d7dad710dbd3bef9cd89ec24",
