          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0154"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::d1b3b78fff1cfd7128085c82",
          "source_handle": "P0154",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ],
          "value": "作为一篇综述，本研究未进行新的实验数据采集，而是通过系统性文献回顾，整合了关于皮肤微生物组组成、空间异质性、免疫调节机制以及临床干预措施的多学科证据。作者将材料组织为：1) 皮肤共生菌的组成与空间分布；2) 共生菌在免疫稳态中的作用机制；3) AD的免疫特征与失衡；4) 菌群-免疫-屏障的恶性循环；5) 基于微生物组的临床应用与未来疗法。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cf4c1b6e827b39baa70b33a9"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0154"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::9a05ab0f6a4ed411ae24a7f5",
          "source_handle": "P0154",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits"
          ],
          "value": {
            "contribution": "提供了AD病理中“菌群-免疫-屏障”三角关系的综合机制框架，特别是明确了共生菌代谢物（SCFAs, 色氨酸衍生物）对AHR和HDAC通路的调控作用。",
            "limits": "所给摘要未交代具体的文献检索策略、纳入排除标准及质量评价方法；部分机制描述基于动物模型或体外研究，其在人体内的确切效力尚需更多临床数据验证。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cf4c1b6e827b39baa70b33a9"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0154"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::741772badca9ce611340d694",
          "source_handle": "P0154",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "健康皮肤 vs AD皮损",
            "finding": "AD皮损中金黄色葡萄球菌（S. aureus）绝对丰度显著增加并与疾病严重程度正相关，而共生菌（如S. epidermidis, C. acnes）丰度降低，导致多样性下降（Shannon指数降低40-60%）。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cf4c1b6e827b39baa70b33a9"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0154"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::1c087ac177d0a23542443077",
          "source_handle": "P0154",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "共生菌免疫调节机制",
            "finding": "S. epidermidis通过分泌抗菌肽抑制S. aureus，并通过TLR2信号诱导IL-1β/IL-6促进Th17分化同时上调Foxp3增强Treg功能；色氨酸代谢物（如IAId）作为AHR配体抑制TSLP表达，从而减轻Th2炎症。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cf4c1b6e827b39baa70b33a9"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0154"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::679eb1daad55b087013bfa25",
          "source_handle": "P0154",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "肠道-皮肤轴干预",
            "finding": "口服特定益生菌（如Limosilactobacillus fermentum SLAM216或Bifidobacterium组合）可降低儿童AD患者的SCORAD评分，机制涉及增加粪便短链脂肪酸浓度及调节肠道菌群比例。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cf4c1b6e827b39baa70b33a9"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0154"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::5b1f0eb2fe91c950f3e6dd66",
          "source_handle": "P0154",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "传统疗法局限性与新疗法潜力",
            "finding": "Dupilumab虽有效但存在潜在淋巴瘤风险；靶向微生物组的疗法（如自体S. hominis A9菌株、噬菌体、内溶素）在早期临床试验中显示出修复屏障和抑制炎症的潜力，但仍处于Phase I/II阶段。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cf4c1b6e827b39baa70b33a9"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0154"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::1c446a679f2e091a0d075ff1",
          "source_handle": "P0154",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ],
          "value": "review",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cf4c1b6e827b39baa70b33a9"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0154"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::1fd8eb8d8a18c05467339f07",
          "source_handle": "P0154",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "旨在解决传统AD疗法（如糖皮质激素、生物制剂）长期使用的副作用及无法根治免疫失衡的问题，探索通过调节皮肤及肠道微生物组来恢复免疫稳态的新机制和治疗途径。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cf4c1b6e827b39baa70b33a9"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0154"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::549c0bca352d7608049f51f8",
          "source_handle": "P0154",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "特应性皮炎（AD）患者的皮肤微生态、宿主免疫反应及皮肤屏障功能之间的相互作用；涉及肠道-皮肤轴在AD发病机制中的潜在角色。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cf4c1b6e827b39baa70b33a9"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0154"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::04e9a73dca7588ad83f3ad87",
          "source_handle": "P0154",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "本文是一篇综述，系统分析了皮肤共生菌与宿主免疫系统在特应性皮炎（AD）稳态维持与失衡中的作用。文章首先阐述了皮肤微生物群的空间分布及其组成变化，指出金黄色葡萄球菌（S. aureus）的富集和共生菌（如表皮葡萄球菌 S. epidermidis）的减少是AD皮损的特征。接着，详细探讨了共生菌通过代谢产物（如短链脂肪酸SCFAs、色氨酸代谢物）、抗菌肽分泌及受体信号通路（如TLR2、AHR）调节Th1/Th2/Th17免疫平衡的机制。文章进一步描述了“菌群失调-免疫激活-屏障破坏”的恶性循环，并评估了基于益生菌、益生元、噬菌体及粪菌移植等靶向微生物组的新型治疗策略的临床潜力与传统疗法的局限性。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cf4c1b6e827b39baa70b33a9"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0154"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::0f8081b65be3ae1ee4455eac",
          "source_handle": "P0154",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "文中关于共生菌（如S. epidermidis）通过TLR2信号诱导Treg分化，以及色氨酸代谢物通过AHR通路抑制Th2炎症的描述。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cf4c1b6e827b39baa70b33a9"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0154"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::484d18ae40eebafc80220a66",
          "source_handle": "P0154",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "文中提到的益生菌（L. fermentum）、益生元、噬菌体和自体细菌移植在AD中的早期临床试验结果（如SCORAD评分改善）。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cf4c1b6e827b39baa70b33a9"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0154"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::29fbf81a5950559cf7f1ac3a",
          "source_handle": "P0154",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "研究对象为皮肤和肠道微生物，疾病为AD而非癌症；涉及的免疫通路主要为Th2/Th17/Treg，与ICI相关的CD8+ T细胞耗竭或激活机制不同。不能直接外推至ICI疗效预测。",
            "contribution": "提供了微生物组调节适应性免疫（特别是T细胞亚群极化）的详细机制案例。具体展示了共生菌如何通过代谢物（SCFAs, 色氨酸衍生物）和表面分子（PSA, LTA）影响DC细胞活化及Treg/Th17平衡。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cf4c1b6e827b39baa70b33a9"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0154"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::80e0594fb6192c6dbcbb085c",
          "source_handle": "P0154",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "这些机制是在AD炎症背景下描述的，重点在于抗炎和屏障修复，而非抗肿瘤免疫监视。具体分子通路（如JAK-STAT, STAT6）与ICI的主要效应通路（PD-1/PD-L1, CTLA-4）无直接重叠。",
            "contribution": "阐述了微生物代谢物（如SCFAs）通过表观遗传修饰（HDAC抑制）和受体信号（GPR43, AHR）调节免疫细胞功能的分子机制。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cf4c1b6e827b39baa70b33a9"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0154"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::f98a4601fa400af7e7804c34",
          "source_handle": "P0154",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "本文研究对象为特应性皮炎（AD），非实体瘤。其涉及的免疫机制（Th2主导）与ICI治疗中关注的抗肿瘤免疫（通常涉及Th1/CD8+ T细胞）存在显著差异，不可直接套用结论。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cf4c1b6e827b39baa70b33a9"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0154"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::2c5f1e5c0bc588c23fb79a36",
          "source_handle": "P0154",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "文中提到的肠道-皮肤轴机制主要基于AD背景下的观察，其与肠道微生物组影响ICI疗效的具体连接点（如特定菌属、代谢物）在本材料中未明确建立，需谨慎推断。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cf4c1b6e827b39baa70b33a9"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0154"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::9356ec5b54d3437f4a20b895",
          "source_handle": "P0154",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "部分机制（如AHR通路、SCFA作用）在AD中已被详细描述，但在ICI语境下是否同样关键，需结合其他专门针对肿瘤的研究进行验证，本材料仅提供平行领域的机制参考。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cf4c1b6e827b39baa70b33a9"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0154"
        },
