          "value": {
            "conditions": "肠道微生物群状态",
            "finding": "健康的肠道微生物群通过抗原交叉反应、诱导局部免疫调节细胞因子及分泌代谢物进入循环，促进抗肿瘤免疫反应。菌群失调（dysbiosis）或与抗生素、PPIs、类固醇等药物合用可能导致ICI疗效降低。FMT和益生菌显示出恢复ICI敏感性的潜力。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::4e8a6b09792021ffa6ec9129"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0157"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::0cd08aae88614206db9e19de",
          "source_handle": "P0157",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "联合治疗策略",
            "finding": "联合抗VEGF疗法（如阿替利珠单抗+贝伐珠单抗）在NSCLC中显示出优于单药的PFS和OS。联合LAG3抑制剂（如Relatlimab）在黑色素瘤中改善了PFS。然而，某些组合（如PARPi+ICI在前列腺癌中，或MEKi+ICI在结直肠癌中）未能达到主要终点，提示需更精准的生物标志物筛选。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::4e8a6b09792021ffa6ec9129"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0157"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::967383f1a9613aa06dcd7510",
          "source_handle": "P0157",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ],
          "value": "review",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::4e8a6b09792021ffa6ec9129"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0157"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::d985c00bbd5dd5f524cd03c2",
          "source_handle": "P0157",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "尽管ICIs在某些癌症中取得了成功，但许多患者存在原发性无响应或获得性耐药。目前缺乏通用的预测生物标志物，且耐药机制复杂多样。本研究旨在厘清这些耐药机制，并评估当前及新兴的治疗策略以克服耐药，从而提高ICI的整体疗效。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::4e8a6b09792021ffa6ec9129"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0157"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::f394ce3ba72cb66e8347805b",
          "source_handle": "P0157",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）在实体瘤治疗中的应用，重点聚焦于原发性及获得性耐药机制，以及克服这些耐药性的潜在策略。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::4e8a6b09792021ffa6ec9129"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0157"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::48ba1baa9e8764797e1b0b2a",
          "source_handle": "P0157",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "本文是一篇综述文章，旨在系统梳理T细胞介导的抗肿瘤免疫反应原理，分析癌症细胞对ICIs产生原发性或获得性耐药的多种机制，并探讨逆转这些耐药性的治疗策略。文章首先回顾了从Coley毒素到现代ICI的发展历程，随后详细阐述了T细胞激活、浸润肿瘤微环境（TME）、效应功能及维持免疫记忆的过程。在此基础上，文章将耐药机制按免疫激活的连续阶段进行分类：包括免疫细胞进入TME受阻、抗肿瘤免疫反应启动失败、效应功能减弱以及免疫反应无法持续。此外，还讨论了宿主因素如肠道微生物群和合并用药对ICI疗效的影响。最后，文章总结了多种克服耐药的策略，包括增强肿瘤免疫原性、改善免疫抑制性微环境、逆转T细胞耗竭、联合小分子抑制剂以及调节肠道微生物群等。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::4e8a6b09792021ffa6ec9129"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0157"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::9b66a4b55098fcaaebeb01a3",
          "source_handle": "P0157",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "提供的临床数据多为小规模试点研究或回顾性分析，样本量有限。益生菌的具体菌株、剂量和最佳给药时机尚未标准化。",
            "contribution": "提供了肠道微生物群影响ICI疗效的具体临床观察和初步干预结果。例如，引用了一项转移性肾细胞癌患者的前瞻性研究，显示添加含丁酸梭菌的益生菌显著提高了客观缓解率（59% vs 11%）和中位PFS。另一项黑色素瘤研究显示，FMT联合ICI使ORR达到65%，且只有那些微生物群持续向供体靠拢的患者才产生响应。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::4e8a6b09792021ffa6ec9129"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0157"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::364dbf079e83dbf95674cbaa",
          "source_handle": "P0157",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "部分机制（如Fap2-TIGIT相互作用）主要基于临床前模型或体外研究，其在人体内的确切贡献程度尚需更多临床验证。不同癌症类型中主导机制可能不同，文中未区分具体癌种的机制差异。",
            "contribution": "详细阐述了微生物群影响免疫系统的三条主要机制：1. 抗原交叉反应（Cross-reactivity）：针对细菌抗原致敏的T细胞可识别具有相同抗原表位的肿瘤细胞；2. 局部免疫调节：微生物诱导产生全身性扩散的免疫调节细胞因子，改变TME中的免疫细胞亚群分布；3. 代谢物调节：正常微生物群分泌的代谢物进入血液循环，影响Th细胞活化、抗体分泌及DC/巨噬细胞功能。此外，还提到了Fap2蛋白结合TIGIT触发抑制信号的潜在机制。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::4e8a6b09792021ffa6ec9129"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0157"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::ff069d73d1526888fa4862b1",
          "source_handle": "P0157",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "关于类固醇影响的因果关系存在不确定性，作者指出这可能反映的是患者本身较差的性能状态或肿瘤生物学特征，而非类固醇本身的直接药理作用。证据等级多为回顾性队列研究。",
            "contribution": "指出了干扰肠道微生物群的常见医疗行为（抗生素、PPIs、类固醇）对ICI疗效的负面影响。特别指出抗生素的使用时机可能很重要（治疗后使用可能不影响），而类固醇的使用指征（管理副作用 vs 改善症状）可能与疗效差异相关，但也可能是预后不良的表现。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::4e8a6b09792021ffa6ec9129"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0157"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::08d9491dd9f7bbae2acf9f74",
          "source_handle": "P0157",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "文章第3节详细列出了基于免疫激活阶段的耐药机制，包括TME物理屏障、抗原呈递缺陷、免疫抑制性细胞因子（TGF-β, IL-10）、代谢压力（缺氧、乳酸）以及替代检查点（TIM-3, LAG3, TIGIT）的上调。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::4e8a6b09792021ffa6ec9129"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0157"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::ca99d772ebb7af576860fc44",
          "source_handle": "P0157",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "文章第4节比较了多种克服耐药的策略，包括联合化疗/放疗（增加免疫原性）、抗VEGF疗法（改善血管和免疫抑制）、靶向替代检查点（LAG3, TIM-3, TIGIT）以及细胞疗法（TILs, CAR-T）。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::4e8a6b09792021ffa6ec9129"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0157"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::8141dc3397c9ac099a6968ba",
          "source_handle": "P0157",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "本文是综述性质，其引用的临床试验结果（如KEYNOTE, CheckMate, IMpower150等）代表的是特定研究的设计和结果，不应视为对所有患者的普遍保证。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::4e8a6b09792021ffa6ec9129"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0157"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::f546b1796a81c51782b2c124",
          "source_handle": "P0157",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "关于微生物群与ICI疗效的关系，文中提到的机制多为假设性或基于动物模型/小规模人类研究的推断，尚未形成确凿的因果链条。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::4e8a6b09792021ffa6ec9129"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0157"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::a7785df44e6eb97a3ddfe002",
          "source_handle": "P0157",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "对于合并用药（如类固醇）的影响，作者明确指出可能存在混杂因素（如患者基线状况），因此在解读时需保持谨慎，避免简单归因。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::4e8a6b09792021ffa6ec9129"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0157"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::05e9f7337b8961908a90c65b",
          "source_handle": "P0157",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "不同癌症类型（如黑色素瘤、NSCLC、肾癌）对ICI的反应和耐药机制存在差异，文中虽提及但未深入区分每种机制在所有实体瘤中的普适性。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::4e8a6b09792021ffa6ec9129"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
