            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ],
          "value": "empirical",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::9cc12751d782ca6db2e16bcd"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch3",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_003\\91eee61491f488e16f81be04d8f112d83ba92e728c1e4bb2c3b0864271a87189\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0186"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::7247ccac03a0e89f056f79d4",
          "source_handle": "P0186",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "尽管已知肠道微生物组影响ICI疗效，且BRB饮食能富集毛螺菌科并增强疗效，但具体是哪些毛螺菌科菌株起作用，以及它们通过何种分子机制介导这种疗效增强？特别是为何某些菌株有效而其他近缘菌株无效？",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::9cc12751d782ca6db2e16bcd"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch3",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_003\\91eee61491f488e16f81be04d8f112d83ba92e728c1e4bb2c3b0864271a87189\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0186"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::16c32a22f7ba956f404fab1f",
          "source_handle": "P0186",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "研究对象为肠道共生菌毛螺菌科（Lachnospiraceae）中的特定菌株，包括 Blautia obeum、Blautia massiliensis 和 Agathobacter rectalis。情境涉及小鼠异种移植模型（MC38结肠癌细胞），干预措施包括饮食补充黑覆盆子汁（BRB）以富集微生物组，以及单独补充上述三种菌株。主要测量方式包括肿瘤生长对免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI，抗PD-1）的反应、细菌基因组比较分析（KEGG正交ologs）、通路富集分析。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::9cc12751d782ca6db2e16bcd"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch3",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_003\\91eee61491f488e16f81be04d8f112d83ba92e728c1e4bb2c3b0864271a87189\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0186"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::a82dcd72572ecce43a444ce9",
          "source_handle": "P0186",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "该研究旨在探究毛螺菌科成员如何影响免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）的疗效。基于BEWELL试验中BRB饮食能富集毛螺菌科并增强小鼠ICI抗肿瘤活性的背景，作者进一步通过单菌株补充实验，比较了三种相关菌株（B. obeum, B. massiliensis, A. rectalis）对ICI疗效的影响差异。研究发现前两种菌株能改善ICI效果，而后者不能。随后，通过对这三种菌株进行全基因组比较，识别出仅在前两种有效菌株中存在而在无效菌株中缺失的177个KEGG正交ologs。通过KEGG通路分析，这些独特基因被归类为四个与免疫和ICI反应相关的代谢/信号通路：乙酰辅酶A合成（Wood-Ljungdahl途径）、T细胞增殖所需维生素（叶酸B9和钴胺素B12）合成、L-鼠李糖合成（作为微生物相关分子模式激活先天免疫），以及胆汁酸转化为次级异构胆汁酸以调节Th17/Treg平衡。结论认为，BRB响应的毛螺菌科拥有富集的代谢和免疫调节基因程序，这可能解释了其与改善ICI肿瘤反应的关联。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::9cc12751d782ca6db2e16bcd"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch3",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_003\\91eee61491f488e16f81be04d8f112d83ba92e728c1e4bb2c3b0864271a87189\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0186"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::e86addc4efe0be3602bff7ba",
          "source_handle": "P0186",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "仅限于毛螺菌科内的三个特定菌株；未涵盖其他门类的细菌；未提供人类临床试验的直接疗效数据，仅为小鼠模型和基因组关联。",
            "contribution": "提供了毛螺菌科内部不同菌株对ICI疗效影响的差异性证据。明确指出并非所有毛螺菌科成员都能增强ICI疗效，只有特定的Blautia物种（obeum, massiliensis）有效，而Agathobacter rectalis无效。这有助于在综述中细化“有益菌群”的定义，避免将毛螺菌科视为同质化整体。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::9cc12751d782ca6db2e16bcd"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch3",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_003\\91eee61491f488e16f81be04d8f112d83ba92e728c1e4bb2c3b0864271a87189\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0186"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::14bd5d132f3dc0569f4cb4e9",
          "source_handle": "P0186",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "这些机制是基于基因组存在的预测（in silico），尚未在体内通过代谢物测量或基因敲除实验得到直接验证。例如，未证明乙酸确实达到了影响T细胞的浓度，也未证明L-鼠李糖确实发挥了MAMP作用。",
            "contribution": "提出了四种具体的潜在分子机制路径，基于基因组比较发现的有效菌株特有基因：(1) 乙酸生产（Wood-Ljungdahl途径）作为T细胞能量源；(2) 叶酸和钴胺素合成促进T细胞增殖；(3) L-鼠李糖合成作为MAMP激活先天免疫；(4) 胆汁酸转化调节Th17/Treg平衡。这些为理解微生物如何代谢调控宿主免疫提供了具体的生化线索。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::9cc12751d782ca6db2e16bcd"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch3",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_003\\91eee61491f488e16f81be04d8f112d83ba92e728c1e4bb2c3b0864271a87189\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0186"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::74e4dd989470e23c5e5af4a3",
          "source_handle": "P0186",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "BEWELL试验中BRB饮食富集毛螺菌科并增强ICI疗效的背景信息。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::9cc12751d782ca6db2e16bcd"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch3",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_003\\91eee61491f488e16f81be04d8f112d83ba92e728c1e4bb2c3b0864271a87189\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0186"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::2ae9be8be2de26595260ab12",
          "source_handle": "P0186",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "同一科内不同菌株对ICI疗效的不同影响（B. obeum/massiliensis vs A. rectalis）。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::9cc12751d782ca6db2e16bcd"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch3",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_003\\91eee61491f488e16f81be04d8f112d83ba92e728c1e4bb2c3b0864271a87189\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0186"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::de9177c122051996908b7278",
          "source_handle": "P0186",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "该研究的机制结论完全基于基因组比对和通路富集分析，属于相关性或预测性证据，而非功能性验证。在综述中引用其机制部分时，应明确标注为“基因组预测的潜在机制”，而非已证实的生理机制。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::9cc12751d782ca6db2e16bcd"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch3",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_003\\91eee61491f488e16f81be04d8f112d83ba92e728c1e4bb2c3b0864271a87189\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0186"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::bba4b9f5c75ccc1842a8848d",
          "source_handle": "P0186",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "研究对象为小鼠模型，且使用的是异种移植模型（MC38），其结果外推到人类实体瘤患者时需考虑物种差异和模型局限性。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::9cc12751d782ca6db2e16bcd"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch3",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_003\\91eee61491f488e16f81be04d8f112d83ba92e728c1e4bb2c3b0864271a87189\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0186"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::ccda48a2f8526b4cad07a206",
          "source_handle": "P0186",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "仅涉及毛螺菌科内的三个菌株，不能代表整个肠道微生物组或毛螺菌科的全部多样性。",
          "role": "evidence",
