        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::888e46cf068a669f02f24630",
          "source_handle": "P0195",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ],
          "value": "体内实验：建立B16.OVA黑色素瘤和Panc02胰腺癌皮下移植模型。设置对照组、DAT单药组、ICI单药组及DAT+ICI联合组。引入广谱抗生素（Abx）混合液饮水处理以诱导肠道菌群失调，评估DAT对菌群失调导致的ICI抵抗的补偿作用。使用Ifnar1-/-小鼠验证宿主IFN-I信号在DAT介导的免疫增强中的必要性。体外实验：分离脾脏T细胞和骨髓来源树突状细胞（DC），在TCR刺激或LPS共刺激条件下，检测DAT对细胞活化标志物（如CD25, IFNγ, CD80/86）的影响。分析手段包括流式细胞术（TME免疫细胞图谱）、16S-rRNA测序（肠道菌群组成变化）、靶向代谢组学（粪便DAT水平测定）及生存分析。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::f4dd731b745b7c3e483c2547"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0195"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::7dd61fd659b69e3af70bbfb8",
          "source_handle": "P0195",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits"
          ],
          "value": {
            "contribution": "识别了细菌代谢物DAT作为IFN-I调节剂，能够协同ICI增强抗肿瘤T细胞免疫的具体表型和机制依赖关系。",
            "limits": "所给摘要未交代DAT在体内的确切受体或上游感知机制；仅在小鼠模型中验证，尚未在人类临床试验中证实安全性和有效性；DAT对菌群组成的改变是因果还是伴随现象尚不明确。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::f4dd731b745b7c3e483c2547"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0195"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::985c2cbb806631682ca1d391",
          "source_handle": "P0195",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "B16.OVA黑色素瘤模型 + 抗CTLA-4治疗",
            "finding": "口服DAT显著延迟肿瘤生长并提高长期生存率，表现为肿瘤微环境（TME）中IFNγ+ CD4+和CD8+ T细胞以及NK细胞的频率和活性增加。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::f4dd731b745b7c3e483c2547"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0195"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::05f735350695e36e26a7cb93",
          "source_handle": "P0195",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "Ifnar1-/-小鼠模型 + 抗CTLA-4治疗",
            "finding": "DAT的协同增效作用完全消失，表明DAT增强ICI疗效严格依赖于宿主完整的IFN-I信号通路。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::f4dd731b745b7c3e483c2547"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0195"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::165122414afb942c2406b476",
          "source_handle": "P0195",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "广谱抗生素（Abx）诱导的菌群失调模型 + 抗CTLA-4治疗",
            "finding": "虽然DAT不能阻止抗生素引起的肠道细菌耗竭，但能部分恢复抗CTLA-4的抗肿瘤疗效，延长生存期，并促进循环中抗原特异性T细胞的扩增。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::f4dd731b745b7c3e483c2547"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0195"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::07ae42b41e4955681f2cc681",
          "source_handle": "P0195",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "体外T细胞培养 + TCR/CD28刺激",
            "finding": "DAT直接增强TCR刺激下的CD8+ T细胞活化（IFNγ+和CD25+表达增加）及CD4+ T细胞向Th1分化（T-bet+）。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::f4dd731b745b7c3e483c2547"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0195"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::a093daeeb0d505493c0b4dd2",
          "source_handle": "P0195",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "体外DC培养 + LPS刺激",
            "finding": "DAT仅在存在LPS（TLR4配体）共刺激时，才能促进DC表面共刺激分子CD80/CD86的表达成熟。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::f4dd731b745b7c3e483c2547"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0195"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::fc1e295c2ab5cc778e7db888",
          "source_handle": "P0195",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "口服DAT干预7天",
            "finding": "改变肠道菌群组成，降低α多样性，增加拟杆菌目（Bacteroidales）和伯克霍尔德菌目（Burkholderiales）的相对丰度，减少梭菌纲（Clostridia）丰度。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::f4dd731b745b7c3e483c2547"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0195"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::e27f805573a80b8a3f3788e3",
          "source_handle": "P0195",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ],
          "value": "empirical",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::f4dd731b745b7c3e483c2547"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0195"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::52c892c3b6cd018eb8a2f462",
          "source_handle": "P0195",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "尽管肠道微生物群影响ICI疗效，但其具体分子机制尚不明确，且临床常因抗生素使用导致菌群失调从而降低免疫治疗效果。本研究试图确定特定的细菌代谢物DAT是否能作为一种可调控的手段，通过调节IFN-I信号来克服ICI治疗的个体差异和耐药性。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::f4dd731b745b7c3e483c2547"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0195"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::556ff9367c28f081086ed707",
          "source_handle": "P0195",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "C57Bl/6j小鼠及Ifnar1-/-基因缺陷小鼠；恶性黑色素瘤（B16.OVA）和胰腺腺癌（Panc02）模型；肠道微生物群与宿主免疫系统的相互作用。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::f4dd731b745b7c3e483c2547"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0195"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::646fbc28c59fc6ce0b38677d",
          "source_handle": "P0195",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "本研究旨在探讨细菌代谢物脱氨酪氨酸（DAT）作为I型干扰素（IFN-I）调节剂，能否增强实体瘤对免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI，如抗CTLA-4或抗PD-1）的治疗反应。研究通过口服补充DAT，在多种小鼠肿瘤模型中评估其抗肿瘤效果，并利用广谱抗生素诱导菌群失调模型模拟临床耐药情境，同时利用IFN-I信号缺失小鼠解析其分子机制。研究发现DAT能协同ICI增强T细胞活化，且该效应依赖于宿主IFN-I信号通路，并能部分逆转抗生素引起的治疗抵抗。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::f4dd731b745b7c3e483c2547"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0195"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::6838df479a72b9114a197ac7",
          "source_handle": "P0195",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "引言部分引用了多项关于抗生素使用、菌群失调与ICI抵抗相关的临床研究及基础研究发现。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::f4dd731b745b7c3e483c2547"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0195"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::423b87cb6e2ccf6e584bed2c",
          "source_handle": "P0195",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "结果显示DAT不加重ICI诱导的结肠炎，反而可能减轻亚临床肠道炎症。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::f4dd731b745b7c3e483c2547"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0195"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::d09b8a9594eb1b512fbd4ae9",
          "source_handle": "P0195",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "机制主要基于小鼠模型；体外DC成熟需要LPS共刺激，体内具体触发条件尚不完全清楚。",
            "contribution": "揭示了DAT增强ICI疗效的分子机制依赖于宿主IFN-I信号通路（通过Ifnar1-/-小鼠验证），并展示了DAT在体外直接促进T细胞活化和DC成熟（需共刺激）的能力。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::f4dd731b745b7c3e483c2547"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0195"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::970a4082112ed9c38f16ae1b",
          "source_handle": "P0195",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "DAT并未恢复菌群多样性，仅改善了功能输出；效果不如在正常菌群小鼠中显著。",
            "contribution": "证明了在广谱抗生素诱导的肠道菌群严重失调（模拟临床常见耐药情境）下，外源性补充DAT仍能部分恢复ICI（抗CTLA-4）的抗肿瘤疗效。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::f4dd731b745b7c3e483c2547"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0195"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::59f2b3186a5ea5b50d9a0a4c",
          "source_handle": "P0195",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "作者明确指出菌群变化的因果贡献尚不明确，可能是伴随现象。",
            "contribution": "观察到DAT补充改变了肠道菌群结构（增加拟杆菌目等），并提示这种改变可能与有益反应相关，但未确立因果关系。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::f4dd731b745b7c3e483c2547"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0195"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::cc0d0b328bb17e240f824a5d",
          "source_handle": "P0195",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "DAT的作用高度依赖于宿主IFN-I信号，若综述涉及其他信号通路（如AhR），需注意区分。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::f4dd731b745b7c3e483c2547"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
