        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::d18001bbef37cba34d6c9141",
          "source_handle": "P0195",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "DAT在抗生素处理组的效果是“部分恢复”，而非完全逆转，不可夸大其作为菌群替代疗法的普适性。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::f4dd731b745b7c3e483c2547"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0195"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::ce5a00e0b7ce348354618096",
          "source_handle": "P0195",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "体外实验中DAT对DC的作用需要LPS共刺激，这暗示体内可能存在复杂的微生物-宿主互作背景，不能简单推断为DAT直接激活DC。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
