        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::2a79995effce4261969675a5",
          "source_handle": "P0204",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ],
          "value": "empirical",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd3"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0204"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::ef87d1d6193307757b844816",
          "source_handle": "P0204",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "尽管已有研究探讨肠道细菌与ICI反应的联系，但ICI治疗HCC队列中多界（细菌、真菌）微生物组的改变及其相互作用尚不完全清楚。本研究试图填补这一知识空白，探索多界微生物群作为ICI疗效预测和预后生物标志物的潜力。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd3"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0204"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::183043c3b1c9680f25443df6",
          "source_handle": "P0204",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗的晚期肝细胞癌（HCC）患者队列，涉及肠道细菌、真菌及其代谢产物的多组学分析。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd3"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0204"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::ed7c33dc13b8de7d574213bb",
          "source_handle": "P0204",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "该研究旨在阐明多界肠道微生物群在ICI治疗HCC中的特征及其与临床疗效的关系。研究前瞻性纳入了80名接受ICI治疗的晚期HCC患者，利用宏基因组学、ITS2测序和代谢组学数据，对患者的肠道细菌、真菌及代谢物进行了多组学表征。研究比较了具有持久临床获益（DCB）与非持久临床获益（NDB）患者在治疗前后的微生物多样性变化，并尝试建立基于微生物特征的预测模型。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd3"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0204"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::64ab749a06f23eea2ace9352",
          "source_handle": "P0204",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "结果来自HCC特定人群，外推至其他实体瘤需谨慎；预测模型未经外部验证；仅展示了关联性，未直接证明因果机制。",
            "contribution": "提供了肠道细菌和代谢物多样性及组成与ICI疗效（DCB vs NDB）关联的具体证据，显示细菌/代谢物差异显著而真菌差异较小；同时提供了基于18种细菌的预测模型（AUC=75.63%）。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd3"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0204"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::545d6f781672ec9a07c0a821",
          "source_handle": "P0204",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "摘要未提供这些生物标志物具体的生物学作用机制或实验验证路径；仅为观察性关联，不能直接推断因果机制；样本量有限，可能存在假阳性风险。",
            "contribution": "识别了与生存相关的特定细菌物种（Actinomyces_sp_ICM47, Senegalimassilia_anaerobia）和代谢物（galanthaminone），暗示这些分子可能与免疫治疗的长期效果或患者生存有关。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd3"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0204"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::747964e83aa76daae4a56be8",
          "source_handle": "P0204",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "研究强调了“多界”（multi-kingdom）微生物组的概念，即细菌、真菌和代谢物共同构成复杂的生态系统。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd3"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0204"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::fd1b4e369eef5db85c871b93",
          "source_handle": "P0204",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "研究发现真菌在DCB/NDB间的差异小于细菌，提示不同微生物类群对ICI反应的贡献度可能不同。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd3"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0204"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::2b01ff87b0b1ef6f4f50fdaf",
          "source_handle": "P0204",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "该研究针对的是肝细胞癌（HCC）这一特定实体瘤，其微生物组特征和治疗反应可能与其他实体瘤存在差异，外推时需考虑肿瘤类型特异性。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd3"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
