          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "在dMMR/MSI-H直肠癌TME中",
            "finding": "ICI通过阻断PD-1/PD-L1和CTLA-4通路解除免疫抑制，但过度激活的CD8+ T细胞会错误识别肠上皮细胞抗原，导致黏膜溃疡和穿孔。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::51f89be549975819db34d833"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0217"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::dc967120324ff4312b8260e3",
          "source_handle": "P0217",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "骨骼肌健康状态良好时",
            "finding": "分泌保护性肌动蛋白IL-15和Irisin，分别通过JAK/STAT5和CSF-1/STAT3通路增强抗肿瘤免疫并抑制M2型巨噬细胞极化，从而保护肠黏膜屏障。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::51f89be549975819db34d833"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0217"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::68f1f7fb0220bd4f57d34afe",
          "source_handle": "P0217",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "存在肌肉萎缩（Sarcopenia）时",
            "finding": "病理性高浓度IL-6持续激活NF-κB和JAK/STAT3通路，引发炎症风暴并促进成纤维细胞活化，加剧肠道炎症和纤维化，形成“肌肉萎缩-肠道损伤”恶性循环。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::51f89be549975819db34d833"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0217"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::796aaea2ba6098e425ca1a27",
          "source_handle": "P0217",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "应用多模态影像技术时",
            "finding": "NBI可早期发现黏膜糜烂和隐窝破坏；EUS-SWE可定量评估组织弹性以区分炎症水肿与不可逆纤维化；PET-CT可通过SUV值量化免疫细胞浸润和代谢活性。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::51f89be549975819db34d833"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0217"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::32dbc1f152adbfb434a35f5a",
          "source_handle": "P0217",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ],
          "value": "review",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::51f89be549975819db34d833"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0217"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::36524ce30e3a3dcf0584c6dc",
          "source_handle": "P0217",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "尽管ICI对dMMR/MSI-H直肠癌疗效显著，但过度激活的免疫系统会导致严重的ICI相关结直肠损伤（ICI-CRI），且现有研究往往孤立地关注肠道免疫毒性或肌肉萎缩。本研究旨在阐明ICI-CRI的复杂病理机制，特别是骨骼肌-肌动蛋白轴在其中的核心调控作用，并整合影像学评估与分层修复策略，以解决免疫治疗中疗效与毒性平衡的临床难题。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::51f89be549975819db34d833"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0217"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::2c5af816b476608df7b0cace",
          "source_handle": "P0217",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "直肠癌（Rectal Cancer）免疫治疗，特别是针对dMMR/MSI-H亚型的免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）治疗；聚焦于ICI相关的结直肠损伤（ICI-CRI）及其与骨骼肌健康、肌动蛋白分泌的关联。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::51f89be549975819db34d833"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0217"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::29fbcbaf11332588955333ca",
          "source_handle": "P0217",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "该综述系统阐述了直肠癌肿瘤微环境（TME）的特征及免疫治疗引起的动态重塑，重点探讨了ICI诱导的结直肠损伤（ICI-CRI）的多重病理机制，包括CD8+ T细胞介导的细胞毒性、炎症因子风暴、肠道菌群失调导致的内毒素易位、微血管低灌注和基质纤维化。文章创新性地提出了“骨骼肌-肌动蛋白-肠道损伤”调控轴，指出骨骼肌分泌的肌动蛋白（IL-6, IL-15, Irisin）在调节抗肿瘤免疫与维持肠道稳态之间起核心作用：IL-15和Irisin具有保护作用，而过度分泌的IL-6则加剧炎症。此外，综述还介绍了结合多模态影像（如NBI结肠镜、EUS-SWE、PET-CT）和放射组学的定量监测方法，以及包括阶梯式免疫抑制、微生态重建、代谢支持和肌肉靶向运动/营养在内的分层修复策略，旨在为个性化直肠癌免疫治疗提供理论参考，以最大化疗效并减少胃肠道毒性。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::51f89be549975819db34d833"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0217"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::4b2107dd86fc8bcb2305e4ff",
          "source_handle": "P0217",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "未直接提供菌群改变ICI抗肿瘤疗效的直接因果证据，而是侧重于其在毒性放大中的作用。",
            "contribution": "提供了肠道菌群失调（如Akkermansia muciniphila减少，致病菌增殖）导致LPS易位并激活TLR4/NF-κB通路的机制描述，解释了菌群变化如何加剧ICI引起的全身和局部炎症。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::51f89be549975819db34d833"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0217"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::164e8028853a939519cae127",
          "source_handle": "P0217",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "主要关注肌动蛋白介导的机制，未深入探讨菌群代谢产物（如短链脂肪酸）对肌动蛋白分泌的直接调控细节，需结合其他文献完善菌群-肌肉互作机制。",
            "contribution": "详细阐述了肌动蛋白（IL-6, IL-15, Irisin）信号通路如何调节免疫细胞功能（CD8+ T细胞、NK细胞、Tregs、巨噬细胞）和肠道屏障完整性，揭示了肌肉-肠道轴在介导ICI效应中的分子机制。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::51f89be549975819db34d833"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0217"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::adcbb36487e510b419a3f23e",
          "source_handle": "P0217",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "综述中关于直肠癌TME异质性（热肿瘤vs冷肿瘤）与免疫治疗响应关系的描述，以及骨骼肌作为全身免疫调节器官的概念。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::51f89be549975819db34d833"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0217"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::224903bcc9290c238b45be18",
          "source_handle": "P0217",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "提到的肌肉萎缩患者更易发生严重ICI-Colitis，以及通过运动/营养改善肌动蛋白谱后可减轻损伤的案例。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::51f89be549975819db34d833"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0217"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::cf32a97997422d3a95a713de",
          "source_handle": "P0217",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "多模态影像（NBI, EUS-SWE, PET-CT）在评估ICI相关肠道损伤严重程度和纤维化阶段的临床应用价值。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::51f89be549975819db34d833"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0217"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::f3c7290bcf33b550b4efd818",
          "source_handle": "P0217",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "该综述主要聚焦于直肠癌，特别是dMMR/MSI-H亚型，其结论外推至其他实体瘤或MSS型结直肠癌时需考虑TME异质性差异。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::51f89be549975819db34d833"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0217"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::906b28d3abb5c3b0d77174ec",
          "source_handle": "P0217",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "肌动蛋白的作用多为机制推演和小型研究支持，尚缺乏大规模随机对照试验证实肌动蛋白靶向治疗的普适性。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::51f89be549975819db34d833"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
