        {
          "atom_id": "atom::9511e05d6896aa7fa29e9b9c",
          "source_handle": "P0229",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "治疗毒性管理",
            "finding": "FMT可缓解ICI引起的结肠炎和放疗引起的肠道毒性；Lactobacillus rhamnosus GG通过释放脂磷壁酸（LTA）保护上皮干细胞免受辐射损伤。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0229"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::599db5fe66f0c6df0c804397",
          "source_handle": "P0229",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ],
          "value": "review",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0229"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::bd18c6ef74b443a822a4424f",
          "source_handle": "P0229",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "尽管已有大量关于肠道微生物群影响癌症治疗的证据，但需要综合理解微生物与癌症治疗的具体交互机制，以便识别新的预防策略、对患者进行分层以提高治疗效果并减少并发症。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0229"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::27c44bf3d7caa7f1d1f260de",
          "source_handle": "P0229",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "肠道微生物群在癌症治疗中的作用，涵盖化疗药物、免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）及放疗的疗效调节、肿瘤发生机制、微生物生物标志物、治疗相关毒性的管理以及通过益生菌、粪菌移植（FMT）、噬菌体和纳米技术进行微生物调控的策略。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0229"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::3342e506c85d5bbfddf3ee03",
          "source_handle": "P0229",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "本文是一篇综述，系统梳理了肠道微生物群与癌症治疗之间的相互作用。文章首先阐述了微生物群失调如何促进肿瘤发生（如幽门螺杆菌、具核梭杆菌等），随后重点讨论了不同细菌物种如何通过代谢药物、调节免疫反应或诱导耐药性来影响化疗和免疫治疗的疗效。此外，综述还评估了利用微生物特征作为诊断/预后标志物的潜力，探讨了通过抗生素、益生菌、FMT和新型纳米技术/噬菌体疗法调控微生物群以增强疗效或减轻毒性的策略，并指出了当前研究在因果机制验证、动物模型外推性及临床转化方面的局限性。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0229"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::d68f1d7be2df847cbd65c8ef",
          "source_handle": "P0229",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "相关性不等于因果性；不同研究使用的测序方法（16S vs metagenomics）、样本类型（粪便vs组织）和癌症类型可能导致结果偏差；部分发现仅在小鼠模型中验证，人类数据有限。",
            "contribution": "列举了与ICI疗效正相关和负相关的特定细菌物种。例如，Bacteroides fragilis、Bacteroides thetaiotaomicron、Akkermansia muciniphila、Faecalibacterium prausnitzii、Ruminococcaceae被报道与ICI响应相关；而某些未明确命名的菌群或缺乏有益菌的状态与无响应相关。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0229"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::7de397c7634b39d8bdffe607",
          "source_handle": "P0229",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "许多机制细节（如Akkermansia的具体通路）主要基于小鼠模型或体外实验，人类体内的确切机制仍需更多验证；不同细菌的作用可能相互交织，难以孤立分析单一机制。",
            "contribution": "详细描述了微生物调节ICI疗效的机制：1) Bacteroides species诱导淋巴结Th1反应和肿瘤内树突状细胞成熟；2) Akkermansia muciniphila通过IL-12途径促进CCR9+CXCR3+CD4+ T淋巴细胞募集到肿瘤微环境；3) 微生物通过TLR4激活髓系细胞产生TNF等炎症因子，增强免疫监视；4) 微生物代谢产物（如短链脂肪酸SCFAs）可能增强CD8+ T细胞的记忆潜能。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0229"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::54bb4fdad7705305ec54b250",
          "source_handle": "P0229",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "本题目聚焦ICI，化疗机制可作为背景参考，但不直接回答ICI的特异性机制。",
            "contribution": "指出微生物群也影响化疗疗效，如Gammaproteobacteria代谢吉西他滨导致耐药，而某些细菌增强环磷酰胺疗效。这为理解广义的“抗癌治疗”提供了背景。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0229"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::556dc29681cb461be8b36faa",
          "source_handle": "P0229",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "综述讨论了FMT、益生菌、噬菌体和纳米技术在癌症治疗中的应用潜力及局限性。例如，FMT在缓解ICI结肠炎和放疗毒性中的初步证据，但样本量小、缺乏机制洞察；益生菌临床试验结果不一致，受个体微生物组和宿主基因组影响大；噬菌体和纳米技术尚处于早期阶段。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0229"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::c0a4b24151e52eb58609dc77",
          "source_handle": "P0229",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "提到F. nucleatum在CRC中的诊断价值（结合FIT提高性能），以及与MSI状态、肿瘤位置、预后的关联。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0229"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::984b10a4e42684438bc48144",
          "source_handle": "P0229",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "指出小鼠模型与人类生理的差异、抗生素使用的混杂效应、饮食和环境因素的影响、以及病毒组和真菌组的潜在作用。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0229"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::91ee4199ed9203bb31c2a3e6",
          "source_handle": "P0229",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "该综述是2020年发表的，后续可能有新的重大发现，使用时需注意时效性。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0229"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::054563d2038db64bf6dbf5f8",
          "source_handle": "P0229",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "文中提到的许多机制主要基于小鼠模型（germ-free mice, antibiotic-treated mice），在向人类推广时需格外谨慎，因为小鼠和人类的肠道微生物组成及生理存在显著差异。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0229"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::189ee075d443a0a8a4076fde",
          "source_handle": "P0229",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "对于益生菌和FMT的效果，文中明确指出临床证据有限且存在冲突，不应将其视为已确立的标准疗法。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0229"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::788bf004ee45cd5fa0bb13bd",
          "source_handle": "P0229",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "不同癌症类型（如CRC vs Melanoma vs NSCLC）中微生物的作用可能截然不同，需区分对待，避免过度泛化。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
