            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ],
          "value": "review",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550b"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0231"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::e9ee22d0d649cfdef88dfaa3",
          "source_handle": "P0231",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "研究动机在于ICIs虽然显著改善了多种癌症患者的生存率，但响应率低（13%-69%）且伴随不可预测的免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）。现有证据表明肠道微生物群可能影响这些结果，但具体哪些微生物、通过何种机制影响疗效和毒性尚需系统总结，以便指导临床个性化治疗和开发新的干预策略。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550b"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0231"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::54e701adaced0c19b2d494e0",
          "source_handle": "P0231",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）在实体瘤治疗中的应用，聚焦于肠道微生物群对疗效和免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）的影响，以及粪菌移植（FMT）等干预手段。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550b"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0231"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::c7ad8027bdd3670be2e63b9e",
          "source_handle": "P0231",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "这是一篇2023年发表的综述文章，旨在探讨肠道微生物群如何调节免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）的疗效和毒性。文章首先介绍了肠道微生物作为“隐藏器官”在维持肠道屏障和免疫监视中的作用，随后系统梳理了不同实体瘤（如转移性黑色素瘤、非小细胞肺癌、肾细胞癌、肝细胞癌等）中，特定细菌门类和物种与ICI疗效及irAEs发生的相关性。文章还讨论了微生物代谢产物（如短链脂肪酸、肌苷等）在介导免疫反应中的潜在机制，并总结了通过粪菌移植（FMT）、益生菌、益生元等手段调节肠道菌群以增强疗效或减轻毒性的临床进展与挑战。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550b"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0231"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::6b6fd4c90a28730f2eb6373e",
          "source_handle": "P0231",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "这些关联主要基于观察性研究，存在方法学差异和混杂因素，不能直接确立因果关系。不同研究间结果可能存在矛盾（如拟杆菌门的作用），需结合具体研究条件解读。",
            "contribution": "提供了不同实体瘤类型中，与ICI疗效（响应/无响应）相关的特定肠道微生物门类及代表性菌种的详细列表。例如，指出厚壁菌门和放线菌门中的某些菌常与疗效正相关，而变形菌门常与无响应相关。同时列出了与irAEs发生相关的微生物特征。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550b"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0231"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::e9ef9bbe1d07e4fa2b50d933",
          "source_handle": "P0231",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "机制部分主要基于文献综述和动物模型，人类体内的确切分子通路仍需更多临床验证。作者提出的机制解释属于理论推测，尚未完全证实。",
            "contribution": "概述了微生物影响ICI疗效和毒性的潜在机制，包括微生物代谢产物（如SCFAs、肌苷、多糖A）对免疫系统（如T细胞分化、炎症反应）的调节作用，以及动物实验中微生物干预对肿瘤微环境的影响。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550b"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0231"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::839eaa8272d598a3ac783d7b",
          "source_handle": "P0231",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "介绍了肠道微生物群的基本生理功能（维持肠道屏障、免疫监视）及其作为‘隐藏器官’的重要性，以及ICIs治疗的现状和挑战（响应率低、irAEs频发）。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550b"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
