          ],
          "value": "resolved",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cd95be7cc3e52cf32fafe3e0"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0236"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::17255d138ac250020e5ad8cb",
          "source_handle": "P0236",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ],
          "value": "采用系统综述和荟萃分析方法。按照PRISMA 2020指南进行文献检索（PubMed, Scopus, EMBASE），纳入2018-2025年发表的研究。纳入标准包括：评估实体瘤患者ICI治疗期间ABT暴露与时间事件结局关联的研究，且明确定义了ABT暴露窗口。统计分析主要使用随机效应模型。预先指定的敏感性分析专注于NSCLC亚组，因其样本量最大且方法学同质性最高。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cd95be7cc3e52cf32fafe3e0"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0236"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::d51753b9deb1908a713b7583",
          "source_handle": "P0236",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits"
          ],
          "value": {
            "contribution": "提供了截至2025年关于全身性抗生素暴露影响实体瘤ICI疗效的最新系统综述和荟萃分析数据，特别强调了NSCLC亚组中PFS受损的稳健证据。",
            "limits": "所给摘要未交代具体的抗生素种类、给药时机细节、微生物群具体组成变化机制、以及不同ICI药物类型的分层分析结果。结论基于观察性研究的汇总，因果推断受限。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cd95be7cc3e52cf32fafe3e0"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0236"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::67f30b284f0468dd246028f1",
          "source_handle": "P0236",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "所有纳入的实体瘤患者（N=52,489）",
            "finding": "ABT暴露与较差的总生存期（OS）相关（随机效应HR 1.16, 95% CI 1.03–1.29），以及数值上较差的无进展生存期（PFS）（随机效应HR 1.11, 95% CI 0.95–1.27）。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cd95be7cc3e52cf32fafe3e0"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0236"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::32c37e994a3eb3753a0b281e",
          "source_handle": "P0236",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "NSCLC亚组敏感性分析（N=45,896）",
            "finding": "OS方面观察到中度异质性（I² = 51%），合并固定效应HR为1.05 (95% CI 0.996–1.11)，显示ABT暴露倾向于导致生存率下降的趋势。PFS方面无异质性（I² = 0%），ABT暴露与疾病进展风险显著增加相关（HR 1.16, 95% CI 1.02–1.30），固定效应和随机效应估计值一致。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cd95be7cc3e52cf32fafe3e0"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0236"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::3fd44fd7b782ff4952e9c7bf",
          "source_handle": "P0236",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ],
          "value": "review",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cd95be7cc3e52cf32fafe3e0"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0236"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::5c1371a423934fc6969812f6",
          "source_handle": "P0236",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "尽管免疫检查点抑制剂改变了实体瘤的管理，但只有部分患者能获得持久获益。鉴于肠道微生物群是抗肿瘤免疫的关键调节者，且全身性抗生素治疗会破坏微生物稳态，观察性研究显示抗生素可能损害ICI疗效，但结果异质性大。本研究旨在通过更新的综合分析，特别是针对肿瘤特异性分析，来澄清这种关联。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cd95be7cc3e52cf32fafe3e0"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0236"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::8de64a57f2e00d7504bd561c",
          "source_handle": "P0236",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "实体瘤患者接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗期间，全身性抗生素暴露（ABT）与时间事件结局（总生存期OS、无进展生存期PFS）的关联；特别聚焦于非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）亚组。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cd95be7cc3e52cf32fafe3e0"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0236"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::27cdf5686bb05898ae3904a0",
          "source_handle": "P0236",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "该研究旨在综合现有证据，评估在实体瘤免疫治疗背景下，全身性抗生素使用对疗效的影响。作者遵循PRISMA 2020指南进行了系统综述和荟萃分析，检索了2018年至2025年间PubMed、Scopus和EMBASE数据库中的相关研究。主要发现表明，整体而言，抗生素暴露与较差的总生存期相关，且在非小细胞肺癌亚组中，抗生素暴露与显著增加的疾病进展风险（无进展生存期缩短）一致。这支持了微生物群介导的免疫治疗疗效受损假说。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cd95be7cc3e52cf32fafe3e0"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0236"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::308857ae59dc55b5f77e4a3f",
          "source_handle": "P0236",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "仅展示了抗生素暴露与临床预后的关联，未直接测量或分析微生物群的具体变化。不能直接说明是哪种微生物或机制导致了这种效果。",
            "contribution": "提供了大规模荟萃分析数据，证实全身性抗生素暴露与实体瘤（特别是NSCLC）患者ICI治疗后的较差生存结局（OS和PFS）相关。具体数据显示NSCLC患者中PFS风险显著增加（HR 1.16）。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cd95be7cc3e52cf32fafe3e0"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0236"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::3201db5ff23b171bd73e2f4b",
          "source_handle": "P0236",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "本身不提供具体的分子或细胞机制细节（如特定菌群、代谢物、免疫细胞通路）。其机制主张是基于观察性关联的推论，需结合其他提供机制详情的研究。",
            "contribution": "提出了“微生物群介导的免疫治疗疗效受损”作为潜在机制的解释框架，并呼吁未来研究整合微生物谱分析和标准化的抗生素暴露定义。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cd95be7cc3e52cf32fafe3e0"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0236"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::9207249c58ffe931918a996b",
          "source_handle": "P0236",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "指出尽管ICI改变了实体瘤管理，但仅部分患者获益，且抗生素使用常见且可能有害。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cd95be7cc3e52cf32fafe3e0"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0236"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::dd39525a8af51938be996a01",
          "source_handle": "P0236",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "汇总了15项研究、超过5万名患者的数据，显示了抗生素暴露与不良预后之间的一致性趋势，尤其是在NSCLC中。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cd95be7cc3e52cf32fafe3e0"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0236"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::bb23a156020f0a23101e23b1",
          "source_handle": "P0236",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "该研究为系统综述和荟萃分析，其结论依赖于纳入的观察性研究的质量和设计。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cd95be7cc3e52cf32fafe3e0"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0236"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::1011fed8a101b1db4d987138",
          "source_handle": "P0236",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "关联不等于因果；抗生素暴露可能与患者整体健康状况、感染严重程度等其他混杂因素有关，尽管研究试图控制这些变量，但残余混杂仍可能存在。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cd95be7cc3e52cf32fafe3e0"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0236"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::39b705f8ebf7db818dd6cee0",
          "source_handle": "P0236",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "NSCLC亚组的分析是预先指定的敏感性分析，其结果可能不适用于所有实体瘤类型或其他ICI药物组合。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cd95be7cc3e52cf32fafe3e0"
          ],
