        {
          "atom_id": "atom::f4fcf557233ac972a458ffcb",
          "source_handle": "P0249",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ],
          "value": "采用多阶段混合方法：1) 临床前小鼠模型：使用含5%冻干黑覆盆子粉的合成饮食喂养小鼠，检测肠道菌群变化；2) 人体临床试验（BEWELL Study）：设计为安慰剂对照、随机、交叉试验，纳入96名具有>30包年吸烟史且年龄55-77岁的高危肺癌人群，每日摄入2x80mL黑覆盆子花蜜4周，收集前后肠道微生物组及血液/尿液样本进行分析；3) 转化验证：将BEWELL研究中受试者的粪便移植至无菌或特定条件下的小鼠（C57BL/6J），构建人源化微生物组Avatar模型，皮下注射mc38结肠癌细胞，并给予抗PD-1抗体或同型对照，比较干预前后菌群移植组的肿瘤体积差异。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::739b9062383569e86b04707c"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch4",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_004\\b995d57956e84cb840b6d426921fbc748165b7d5bcb76b80cd617161c4b4a22f\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0249"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::23b5efcdf05aefc8c316c165",
          "source_handle": "P0249",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits"
          ],
          "value": {
            "contribution": "提供了黑覆盆子饮食干预影响人体肠道微生物组的初步证据，并建立了从人体菌群到小鼠肿瘤模型的转化验证路径",
            "limits": "人体试验中目标菌种A. muciniphila未达到统计学显著性；肿瘤抑制结果来自初步实验（Preliminary experiments），样本量和统计效力有限；未直接证明机制，仅展示相关性"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::739b9062383569e86b04707c"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch4",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_004\\b995d57956e84cb840b6d426921fbc748165b7d5bcb76b80cd617161c4b4a22f\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0249"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::8339dcdf922b81a5ed70de0a",
          "source_handle": "P0249",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits"
          ],
          "value": {
            "contribution": "确认了黑覆盆子干预能引起非目标菌群的改变，提示其对微生物组有广泛影响",
            "limits": "具体哪些菌群变化导致了肿瘤抑制效果尚不明确，缺乏详细的机制解析"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::739b9062383569e86b04707c"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch4",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_004\\b995d57956e84cb840b6d426921fbc748165b7d5bcb76b80cd617161c4b4a22f\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0249"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::71d3ecca9ec4f69071bef90c",
          "source_handle": "P0249",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits"
          ],
          "value": {
            "contribution": "在高危肺癌风险人群中验证了饮食干预的安全性和可行性（隐含于试验完成）",
            "limits": "受试者为高危人群而非已确诊癌症患者，其生理状态可能与晚期癌症患者存在差异，外推至治疗场景需谨慎"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::739b9062383569e86b04707c"
