          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::739b9062383569e86b04707c"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch4",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_004\\b995d57956e84cb840b6d426921fbc748165b7d5bcb76b80cd617161c4b4a22f\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0249"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::d1c5000194bec6444e6f2c10",
          "source_handle": "P0249",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ],
          "value": "empirical",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::739b9062383569e86b04707c"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch4",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_004\\b995d57956e84cb840b6d426921fbc748165b7d5bcb76b80cd617161c4b4a22f\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0249"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::bda44282c7a0287bfc92a4a5",
          "source_handle": "P0249",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "主要问题是：如何识别并实施策略来操纵宿主肠道微生物组，从而提高实体瘤患者对免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）的治疗反应？动机在于目前仅约20%的肿瘤对ICI产生响应，且已有数据表明ICI响应可能依赖于宿主微生物组。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::739b9062383569e86b04707c"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch4",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_004\\b995d57956e84cb840b6d426921fbc748165b7d5bcb76b80cd617161c4b4a22f\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0249"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::71627cd04eee6ece83a2c100",
          "source_handle": "P0249",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "研究对象包括小鼠模型（C57BL/6J）和人类受试者（高肺癌风险人群）。研究情境涉及饮食干预对肠道微生物组的影响，以及这种改变对免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）疗效的潜在调节作用。范围限定于黑覆盆子（Black Raspberry, BRB）作为单一饮食干预手段。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::739b9062383569e86b04707c"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch4",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_004\\b995d57956e84cb840b6d426921fbc748165b7d5bcb76b80cd617161c4b4a22f\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0249"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::6859292e2d65ec4399bdb345",
          "source_handle": "P0249",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "该研究旨在探索通过饮食干预调节肠道微生物组以改善实体瘤对免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）反应的可能性。研究首先在小鼠模型中验证冻干黑覆盆子粉能增加与ICI响应相关的Akkermansia muciniphila丰度。随后，开展了一项名为BEWELL的人体随机交叉对照试验，招募96名高危肺癌人群，每日饮用两次80mL黑覆盆子花蜜持续4周。结果显示，尽管未观察到A. muciniphila的显著变化，但其他菌群发生改变。最后，通过将干预后的人体粪便移植到小鼠体内构建“人体微生物组Avatar模型”，并接种结肠癌细胞进行抗PD-1治疗，初步发现接受干预后菌群的小鼠肿瘤生长受到抑制。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::739b9062383569e86b04707c"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch4",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_004\\b995d57956e84cb840b6d426921fbc748165b7d5bcb76b80cd617161c4b4a22f\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0249"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::830de14ad71c312851592534",
          "source_handle": "P0249",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "人体试验中A. muciniphila变化不显著，说明并非所有饮食干预都通过单一菌种起作用；结果基于初步实验，需警惕过度解读因果性。",
            "contribution": "提供了黑覆盆子饮食干预对人体肠道微生物组组成的实际影响数据，以及这种改变在体外（小鼠Avatar模型）对ICI疗效的潜在正向调节作用。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::739b9062383569e86b04707c"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch4",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_004\\b995d57956e84cb840b6d426921fbc748165b7d5bcb76b80cd617161c4b4a22f\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0249"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::cbcb099dbb300df0550a1e8f",
          "source_handle": "P0249",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "该模型本身是工具而非机制解释；具体的分子机制（如抗原呈递、T细胞活化等）在本摘要中未详细阐述，仅表现为肿瘤体积减小。",
            "contribution": "展示了利用‘人体微生物组Avatar模型’（Human microbiome avatar models）来桥接人体菌群变化与肿瘤免疫反应之间关系的实验设计。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::739b9062383569e86b04707c"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch4",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_004\\b995d57956e84cb840b6d426921fbc748165b7d5bcb76b80cd617161c4b4a22f\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0249"
        },
