          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::c7c67d13abcc3ba3a71d2af4"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0250"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::8ab14efc6b30694f0585ce00",
          "source_handle": "P0250",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "尽管抗PD-1免疫疗法显著改善了黑色素瘤患者的生存率，但疗效存在高度异质性。本研究旨在探讨肠道微生物组如何调节这种疗效差异，阐明其背后的免疫学机制，并评估通过调节微生物组（如FMT、饮食、益生菌）来增强免疫治疗效果的潜在策略。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::c7c67d13abcc3ba3a71d2af4"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0250"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::8628c3209fc51cc52f581364",
          "source_handle": "P0250",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "研究对象为黑色素瘤患者的肠道微生物组及其与抗PD-1免疫治疗的相互作用。情境涵盖从基础免疫机制（T细胞激活、代谢物作用）到临床干预策略（FMT、饮食、益生菌）的多个层面。范围主要聚焦于黑色素瘤，但也提及对其他癌症的潜在启示。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::c7c67d13abcc3ba3a71d2af4"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0250"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::683021d8eb786f400362468b",
          "source_handle": "P0250",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "本综述旨在解决抗PD-1免疫疗法在黑色素瘤治疗中疗效变异性大的问题。文章首先介绍了肠道微生物组在维持免疫稳态和启动抗肿瘤免疫中的核心作用，详细阐述了微生物通过直接接触（如GALT中的抗原呈递）和间接代谢产物（如SCFAs）调节宿主免疫系统的机制。随后，文章总结了与良好治疗反应相关的微生物特征（如高多样性、特定菌属丰度）以及与耐药相关的菌群失调状态。最后，综述评估了三种主要的微生物组干预策略：FMT在逆转耐药方面的初步成功、高纤维饮食对SCFA产生的促进作用，以及益生菌使用的潜在益处与安全风险。文章指出，理解并操纵微生物组有望实现更个性化的癌症免疫治疗，但仍需更多临床研究来优化方案并确保安全性。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::c7c67d13abcc3ba3a71d2af4"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0250"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::a8323f303ecbdef63bd0e6a2",
          "source_handle": "P0250",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "主要基于黑色素瘤数据，其他实体瘤的直接证据较少；机制多为相关性或动物模型推断，临床因果链条尚不完全清晰；FMT等证据来自小规模研究。",
            "contribution": "提供了肠道微生物组通过调节T细胞活化和肿瘤微环境来影响抗PD-1疗效的详细机制图谱，包括特定菌种、代谢物和免疫细胞亚群之间的相互作用。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::c7c67d13abcc3ba3a71d2af4"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0250"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::569a8cdab6e82079b6483367",
          "source_handle": "P0250",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "主要关注黑色素瘤；未提供大规模多中心试验结果；不同干预策略的直接比较缺失。",
            "contribution": "总结了目前可用的微生物组干预策略（FMT、饮食、益生菌）在增强ICIs疗效方面的临床前和早期临床证据，并指出了各自的潜在风险和局限性。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::c7c67d13abcc3ba3a71d2af4"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
