          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "指出需要更多临床试验来确定最佳供体、给药频率、长期安全性以及益生菌的具体菌株选择。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::c7c67d13abcc3ba3a71d2af4"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0250"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::1bd8d8dfe3db59cf0389c7a5",
          "source_handle": "P0250",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "本文主要聚焦于黑色素瘤，其结论在其他实体瘤中的适用性需结合其他研究进行验证，不能直接外推。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::c7c67d13abcc3ba3a71d2af4"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0250"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::df6fca6ebe442dac256760bf",
          "source_handle": "P0250",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "文中提到的机制（如特定菌种与T细胞活化的关系）多基于已发表的研究汇总，部分可能源自动物模型，临床因果关系尚未完全确立。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::c7c67d13abcc3ba3a71d2af4"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0250"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::9bcca453aa0ce0902a917b68",
          "source_handle": "P0250",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "FMT的证据主要来自小规模研究（如Davari et al.），其长期安全性和最佳实践方案仍在探索中，不应视为成熟的标准治疗方案。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::c7c67d13abcc3ba3a71d2af4"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0250"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::d5e3281f6e7fa4156b3d92ae",
          "source_handle": "P0250",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "益生菌的使用存在安全争议，文中明确提到需谨慎，避免将其简单推荐为通用辅助疗法。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
